    Liveness card KV: Status / Goroutines fmtInt(system.goroutines ?? 0) / Uptime
      formatUptime(system.uptime_seconds ?? 0) ·
    Readiness card KV: Database / Latency / Pool Connections fmtInt(database_pool.total_conns ?? 0) ·
    header badges: <Badge dot variant=statusToBadgeVariant(livenessStatus)>Live</Badge>
      + <Badge dot variant=statusToBadgeVariant(dbStatus)>Ready</Badge> ·
    statusToBadgeVariant success list omits "connected" (verified by a dedicated test).
